WEBVTT

00:00:01.380 --> 00:00:02.970
We're here!

00:00:03.450 --> 00:00:06.300
This is the home base of 
the Chronos Rulers...

00:00:07.810 --> 00:00:08.810
Chronos!

00:00:09.390 --> 00:00:13.100
I am Snake, head of the technology division.

00:00:14.090 --> 00:00:16.370
It's preventing the flow 
of time out of your body!

00:00:16.630 --> 00:00:19.460
This is most definitely the 
original Oath of Time...

00:00:19.460 --> 00:00:21.450
Also known as UNIQUE!

00:00:21.450 --> 00:00:23.710
This is... Slow Down?!

00:00:21.750 --> 00:00:23.710
<b>Slow Down</b>

00:00:23.710 --> 00:00:24.720
Snake!

00:00:24.720 --> 00:00:26.380
These are the master's orders.

00:00:26.640 --> 00:00:29.090
I cant give you my life just yet.

00:00:29.090 --> 00:00:30.380
Darling, wait!

00:00:31.010 --> 00:00:33.960
If fate sees fit, I'll see you again.

00:00:38.940 --> 00:00:40.810
All the cards were destroyed at once?

00:00:41.330 --> 00:00:42.310
What did this?

00:00:42.310 --> 00:00:45.000
I'm not picky about how I achieve my goals.

00:00:45.000 --> 00:00:46.940
Cheating, deceiving, outwitting...

00:00:47.180 --> 00:00:48.900
I'm a villain to the core, after all.

00:00:48.900 --> 00:00:50.540
<i>So he's a Chronos Ruler, too?</i>

00:00:50.540 --> 00:00:52.070
Hey, now...

00:00:52.070 --> 00:00:54.860
You're a more interesting 
toy than I thought.

00:00:56.930 --> 00:00:59.670
<i>Victor was fixated on 
reclaiming the time he's lost.</i>

00:00:59.670 --> 00:01:02.020
<i>He wouldn't give up on it that easily.</i>

00:01:02.020 --> 00:01:02.700
Here it is!

00:01:03.010 --> 00:01:04.670
The record of my work from back then!

00:01:05.860 --> 00:01:06.790
Huh?

00:01:06.790 --> 00:01:08.680
Wh-What language is this?

00:01:08.680 --> 00:01:11.220
I can't read this crap!

00:01:16.830 --> 00:01:17.840
Victor?

00:01:20.050 --> 00:01:24.280
If a god exists who can save us, 
I'd like to see his face.

00:01:25.740 --> 00:01:27.270
But you've seen one already.

00:01:32.280 --> 00:01:33.400
I'm saying...

00:01:38.250 --> 00:01:39.300
There is a god

00:01:40.120 --> 00:01:42.030
standing right in front of you!

00:01:50.280 --> 00:01:51.720
<i>What was that?</i>

00:01:52.250 --> 00:01:55.820
<i>If I'd jumped back an 
instant later, I'd be dead.</i>

00:01:56.730 --> 00:02:01.730
I am the one and only true descendant 
of the god of time, Chronos,

00:02:02.300 --> 00:02:05.210
and the master of Chronos, the organization
 that subjugates Horologues...

00:02:05.210 --> 00:02:06.690
Aisrehdar.

00:02:07.390 --> 00:02:11.460
I carry within me blood that has flowed 
since the universe was created,

00:02:11.940 --> 00:02:16.870
and have devoted my being to the subjugation 
of Horologues far longer than you have.

00:02:18.660 --> 00:02:21.240
There's no need to be so afraid.

00:02:23.680 --> 00:02:27.620
I'll only be taking back the 
UNIQUE you bear in your chest.

00:02:29.600 --> 00:02:34.250
Once that's done, I'll put you in bed...

00:02:35.870 --> 00:02:36.880
to sleep.

00:04:09.850 --> 00:04:12.980
March 15   15:10

00:04:13.940 --> 00:04:14.270
<b>Slow Down</b>

00:04:15.190 --> 00:04:16.060
Slow Down!

00:04:17.270 --> 00:04:17.480
<b>Release</b>

00:04:20.000 --> 00:04:22.020
<i>My Slow Down was released?!</i>

00:04:23.090 --> 00:04:24.610
What did I tell you?

00:04:24.610 --> 00:04:27.240
I am the descendant of a god.

00:04:27.710 --> 00:04:30.210
All things in creation are under my control.

00:04:30.830 --> 00:04:34.920
<i>Chronos Rulers can only control 
objects within a set range.</i>

00:04:34.920 --> 00:04:36.920
<i>If I can get some distance between us...</i>

00:04:38.170 --> 00:04:39.100
<i>My body...</i>

00:04:42.090 --> 00:04:43.520
<i>This is... Slow Down!</i>

00:04:43.920 --> 00:04:46.040
<i>She's controlling my body?!</i>

00:04:47.660 --> 00:04:53.110
UNIQUE is my own weapon,
which was lost 2,200 years ago.

00:04:53.830 --> 00:04:54.600
No...

00:04:55.050 --> 00:04:59.320
Not a weapon, but more like a 
booster that increases the range

00:04:59.320 --> 00:05:02.110
and strength of my control of time.

00:05:02.680 --> 00:05:07.430
Without UNIQUE, my power is 
now weaker than it once was,

00:05:08.040 --> 00:05:11.800
but still, all things in 
creation are under my control,

00:05:11.800 --> 00:05:15.360
and that includes all living beings.

00:05:17.620 --> 00:05:20.890
To put an immediate end to the 
battle against the Horologues,

00:05:21.280 --> 00:05:24.070
the UNIQUE is absolutely necessary.

00:05:25.020 --> 00:05:28.170
Don't hate me for this, Victor.

00:05:28.660 --> 00:05:29.970
<i>Whoa, whoa, whoa!</i>

00:05:29.970 --> 00:05:33.640
<i>Total control over everything?!</i>

00:05:33.970 --> 00:05:35.530
<i>I have to use Speed Up!</i>

00:05:35.530 --> 00:05:37.390
<i>Kiri will get mad if he finds out, but...</i>

00:05:37.620 --> 00:05:39.400
<i>Desperate times call for desperate measures!</i>

00:05:56.960 --> 00:05:58.390
Someone's fighting...

00:05:59.900 --> 00:06:00.820
It couldn't be!

00:06:04.210 --> 00:06:06.220
No... No, no, no!

00:06:07.490 --> 00:06:08.720
Gotta get there in time!

00:06:22.560 --> 00:06:28.650
500 Years Ago

00:06:28.700 --> 00:06:28.740
500 Years Ago

00:06:28.780 --> 00:06:28.820
500 Years Ago

00:06:28.860 --> 00:06:28.900
500 Years Ago

00:07:42.340 --> 00:07:46.180
Mom, why did you leave me behind?

00:07:46.920 --> 00:07:48.580
It's too selfish!

00:07:50.560 --> 00:07:52.320
Don't cry, Mina.

00:07:53.540 --> 00:07:56.020
She lived more than long enough.

00:07:56.390 --> 00:07:58.370
It was simply her time.

00:07:58.750 --> 00:07:59.830
Sister...

00:08:00.460 --> 00:08:04.990
To us, who live eternal lives thanks 
to the blood of Chronos within us,

00:08:05.850 --> 00:08:08.980
human life seems terribly fleeting.

00:08:10.480 --> 00:08:13.160
Your mother and friends, as well,

00:08:13.770 --> 00:08:17.600
will all leave your side sooner or later.

00:08:18.610 --> 00:08:22.800
They will leave nothing behind 
for you but endless grief

00:08:23.370 --> 00:08:24.650
and memories.

00:08:28.190 --> 00:08:29.230
My mother...

00:08:28.730 --> 00:08:29.230
An Inconvenient Truth

00:08:32.950 --> 00:08:35.010
was always a very tough woman.

00:08:35.010 --> 00:08:38.120
Until only recently, her hair 
was still thick and black.

00:08:39.240 --> 00:08:40.900
Yet, in the end...

00:08:45.180 --> 00:08:46.390
Was it really...

00:08:47.630 --> 00:08:50.010
"just her time"?

00:08:54.630 --> 00:08:57.200
The power of the god who controls time

00:08:57.200 --> 00:08:59.120
is passed on to his descendants.

00:09:00.670 --> 00:09:03.450
You do not yet have the god's power,

00:09:03.860 --> 00:09:06.630
but if I should lose my life,

00:09:07.040 --> 00:09:08.800
you must inherit my power

00:09:08.800 --> 00:09:11.510
and carry on the subjugation 
of the Horologues.

00:09:12.640 --> 00:09:16.250
This is the duty you were born with.

00:09:19.470 --> 00:09:23.200
I offer you this warning 
as your elder sister.

00:09:23.690 --> 00:09:25.880
Engrave your duty in your heart,

00:09:25.880 --> 00:09:29.270
and never let it be undone by any human.

00:09:30.220 --> 00:09:35.050
Otherwise, you will be the one to suffer.

00:09:42.190 --> 00:09:43.970
D-Darling...

00:09:45.630 --> 00:09:47.980
No!

00:09:52.550 --> 00:09:53.900
Stay out of my way!

00:09:58.400 --> 00:09:59.910
Again and again and again!

00:10:00.450 --> 00:10:02.030
And again and again!

00:10:02.030 --> 00:10:04.650
How many times must you get in my way?!

00:10:04.650 --> 00:10:07.150
You took away my mother and all my friends,

00:10:07.150 --> 00:10:09.400
and it still wasn't enough?!

00:10:09.760 --> 00:10:12.140
Victor is the man I love!

00:10:12.380 --> 00:10:12.920
<b>Speed Up</b>

00:10:21.600 --> 00:10:22.640
<b>Speed Up</b>

00:10:38.590 --> 00:10:39.410
<i>What's that?</i>

00:10:40.160 --> 00:10:41.630
<i>I have a bad feeling...</i>

00:10:43.370 --> 00:10:45.260
<i>I don't have time for this guy!</i>

00:10:45.260 --> 00:10:47.120
<i>I have to find Victor at once!</i>

00:10:48.120 --> 00:10:49.400
Speed Up!

00:10:50.120 --> 00:10:51.630
Instant Destruction...

00:10:51.710 --> 00:10:52.630
Instant Destruction by Fire

00:10:53.080 --> 00:10:54.960
by Fire!

00:10:55.370 --> 00:10:56.300
Slow Down!

00:10:56.210 --> 00:10:56.880
<b>Slow Down</b>

00:11:01.800 --> 00:11:03.770
Hey, you running away?

00:11:03.770 --> 00:11:05.810
Play with me a little longer!

00:11:14.870 --> 00:11:16.280
No!

00:11:16.560 --> 00:11:19.640
Finally figured it out, four-eyes?

00:11:19.640 --> 00:11:22.280
When I attacked you with Speed Up,

00:11:22.280 --> 00:11:25.290
I kept my flames burning with Slow Down.

00:11:25.760 --> 00:11:29.600
That's why it's still so hot around here.

00:11:30.050 --> 00:11:33.750
With all that going on, 
water evaporates in no time.

00:11:35.970 --> 00:11:39.210
You're a Chronos Ruler who controls water,

00:11:39.210 --> 00:11:42.630
but if you lose that water...

00:11:42.630 --> 00:11:44.140
You're just some four-eyes!

00:11:56.480 --> 00:11:59.100
Your Oath of Time is an old model!

00:11:59.100 --> 00:12:04.570
Sucks that you can't have Speed Up and Slow
Down active at the same time, doesn't it?!

00:12:06.400 --> 00:12:09.230
With Speed Up, water evaporates in an instant,

00:12:09.230 --> 00:12:12.080
but with Speed Down, all you can do is defend!

00:12:12.080 --> 00:12:13.760
Stresses you out, doesn't it?!

00:12:13.760 --> 00:12:17.840
You know you need to 
hurry or Victor might die!

00:12:18.010 --> 00:12:19.500
More!

00:12:19.500 --> 00:12:21.550
More, more, more, more!

00:12:21.550 --> 00:12:24.160
Let me see you look more helpless!

00:12:24.160 --> 00:12:26.720
Kneel down before evil!

00:12:46.280 --> 00:12:47.960
Darling...

00:12:50.310 --> 00:12:51.390
Please...

00:12:52.520 --> 00:12:54.910
Don't leave me alone.

00:12:56.390 --> 00:12:57.220
No...

00:12:57.780 --> 00:13:02.050
I don't want to feel that way again!

00:13:06.770 --> 00:13:08.150
Get...

00:13:10.520 --> 00:13:11.630
<i>Slow Down!</i>

00:13:10.680 --> 00:13:12.390
<b>Slow Down</b>

00:13:12.390 --> 00:13:14.360
...out of the way!

00:13:14.360 --> 00:13:15.280
<i>Speed Up!</i>

00:13:14.480 --> 00:13:15.770
<b>Speed Up</b>

00:13:16.600 --> 00:13:19.320
<i>My Speed Up and Slow Down won't 
activate simultaneously?</i>

00:13:19.720 --> 00:13:23.030
<i>Why? My Oath of Time is 
a new and improved model!</i>

00:13:24.280 --> 00:13:25.510
Slow Down.

00:13:27.200 --> 00:13:30.160
<b>Slow Down</b>

00:13:27.660 --> 00:13:29.580
My left leg is...

00:13:30.390 --> 00:13:32.180
No matter what you do,

00:13:32.180 --> 00:13:34.370
my resolution won't change.

00:13:34.660 --> 00:13:36.710
Just stay there and be still.

00:13:36.710 --> 00:13:40.640
Struggling too much will 
endanger your trapped leg.

00:13:41.330 --> 00:13:42.630
I told you...

00:13:44.160 --> 00:13:45.840
to move.

00:13:47.570 --> 00:13:49.600
Out of the way!

00:13:49.600 --> 00:13:50.510
Don't move!

00:13:50.500 --> 00:13:52.600
Compared to losing him...

00:13:54.580 --> 00:13:58.540
Losing a leg or two is nothing!

00:14:02.460 --> 00:14:03.860
Please!

00:14:04.670 --> 00:14:06.990
Sisters should have a harmonious bond.

00:14:12.810 --> 00:14:15.330
Darling? But your injuries...

00:14:16.670 --> 00:14:18.670
I don't quite understand it, either,

00:14:19.180 --> 00:14:21.470
but it looks like she missed the vital spot.

00:14:31.860 --> 00:14:33.040
Darling!

00:14:33.930 --> 00:14:35.990
I'm so glad you're safe!

00:14:37.180 --> 00:14:40.180
Thank you for staying alive.

00:14:41.530 --> 00:14:44.550
Don't leave me behind again!

00:14:48.620 --> 00:14:52.490
<i>All this time, I thought her 
words and behaviors were just</i>

00:14:52.490 --> 00:14:55.160
<i>her joking around to make me like her,</i>

00:14:56.560 --> 00:14:58.800
<i>but it seems I was wrong.</i>

00:14:59.790 --> 00:15:01.510
<i>After all, her face as she cries...</i>

00:15:03.890 --> 00:15:05.560
<i>looks just like Kiri's did.</i>

00:15:10.220 --> 00:15:12.780
<i>So you really are...</i>

00:15:20.800 --> 00:15:21.650
Miss Mina.

00:15:22.570 --> 00:15:24.830
No... Mina.

00:15:25.230 --> 00:15:26.200
Don't cry.

00:15:30.280 --> 00:15:32.070
I'll always be with you.

00:15:32.950 --> 00:15:34.250
I won't go anywhere.

00:15:34.720 --> 00:15:35.900
Don't worry.

00:15:42.820 --> 00:15:43.670
Okay!

00:15:48.590 --> 00:15:49.970
Sister!

00:15:50.210 --> 00:15:52.260
Before you start speaking of love,

00:15:52.260 --> 00:15:56.220
you need to think about defending 
your own life, Victor!

00:16:05.090 --> 00:16:07.370
<i>If I keep myself on the 
receiving end, she'll kill me.</i>

00:16:07.370 --> 00:16:08.650
<i>I have to attack!</i>

00:16:08.850 --> 00:16:09.930
Darling!

00:16:10.280 --> 00:16:11.430
Wait, Sist—

00:16:15.150 --> 00:16:17.540
I have no choice. It beats dying!

00:16:17.540 --> 00:16:18.380
Speed Up!

00:16:27.960 --> 00:16:30.960
I used Speed Up, but I'm not losing my time?

00:16:32.140 --> 00:16:33.240
Darling?

00:16:33.720 --> 00:16:36.970
It appears the repair was successful.

00:16:37.310 --> 00:16:38.120
Huh?

00:16:39.630 --> 00:16:41.980
The UNIQUE inside you

00:16:43.420 --> 00:16:48.310
is the one I lost when fighting 
Horologues 2,200 years ago.

00:16:49.770 --> 00:16:54.880
The damage it took then made it 
unable to fully realize its power.

00:16:56.070 --> 00:16:59.440
So what I did before was just to repair it.

00:17:00.900 --> 00:17:05.000
In other words, you can now 
use Speed Up all you want

00:17:05.270 --> 00:17:07.880
without concern for the wound in your chest.

00:17:08.170 --> 00:17:10.000
You weren't trying to kill me?

00:17:10.960 --> 00:17:15.970
The information you gave Chronos 
when you returned alive

00:17:15.970 --> 00:17:18.890
from the Horologue nest twelve years ago...

00:17:19.870 --> 00:17:21.930
was extremely valuable.

00:17:22.650 --> 00:17:25.080
Far more so than your life.

00:17:26.510 --> 00:17:33.280
So I only left UNIQUE with you until 
you managed to regain your lost time.

00:17:34.180 --> 00:17:35.530
I get it.

00:17:36.060 --> 00:17:38.950
So everything that's 
happened since I got here

00:17:39.370 --> 00:17:43.160
was a test to determine whether
or not I'm capable of protecting UNIQUE.

00:17:43.930 --> 00:17:46.540
How'd I do? Not half bad, right?

00:17:46.540 --> 00:17:50.300
If you're not satisfied, there's one 
last thing I've saved up to show you.

00:17:50.300 --> 00:17:52.230
My true strength as a man, that is.

00:17:53.020 --> 00:17:54.340
Darling!

00:17:57.730 --> 00:17:59.680
Don't get the wrong idea.

00:18:02.400 --> 00:18:05.640
Your test is only just beginning.

00:18:06.230 --> 00:18:08.520
If you can defeat me,

00:18:08.520 --> 00:18:11.690
I'll acknowledge you as 
worthy of possessing UNIQUE.

00:18:12.580 --> 00:18:13.690
Sister!

00:18:15.920 --> 00:18:18.130
There's no need to worry.

00:18:18.600 --> 00:18:22.450
I won't exercise direct 
control over your body.

00:18:22.720 --> 00:18:25.520
I should've known it wouldn't be that simple.

00:18:25.960 --> 00:18:28.460
And? What if I lose?

00:18:28.740 --> 00:18:31.730
If you do, you will return UNIQUE to me.

00:18:32.190 --> 00:18:38.470
And I will then eliminate 
every last Horologue myself.

00:18:38.860 --> 00:18:40.090
I see.

00:18:40.810 --> 00:18:43.180
So my life is literally on the line.

00:18:43.940 --> 00:18:44.980
Sounds fun.

00:18:45.920 --> 00:18:47.640
I'll take that bet!

00:18:47.390 --> 00:18:48.850
<b>Slow Down</b>

00:18:51.550 --> 00:18:53.860
Please, stop this, both of you!

00:18:54.170 --> 00:18:55.850
You be quiet.

00:18:56.420 --> 00:18:59.610
This is my duty as the descendant of Chronos!

00:19:02.120 --> 00:19:03.240
Ace Shot!

00:19:14.090 --> 00:19:14.540
<b>Slow Down</b>

00:19:25.550 --> 00:19:26.570
<i>She's tough.</i>

00:19:27.170 --> 00:19:30.220
<i>She's controlling all the 
rocks and air around me...</i>

00:19:30.220 --> 00:19:32.600
<i>Everything but my body itself.</i>

00:19:32.600 --> 00:19:34.150
<i>Of course, that includes my cards.</i>

00:19:34.770 --> 00:19:36.150
What's wrong?

00:19:36.360 --> 00:19:39.900
Is that all there is to your "true strength"?

00:19:41.800 --> 00:19:46.160
A good gambler doesn't play 
his ace on the first hand.

00:19:47.610 --> 00:19:50.500
As of now, it's my turn.

00:19:51.420 --> 00:19:54.830
How foolish. If you use Slow Down
on a wall of cards,

00:19:54.830 --> 00:19:57.420
I only need to offset it with Speed Up!

00:19:56.090 --> 00:19:57.420
<b>Speed Up</b>

00:20:16.650 --> 00:20:18.420
So much power...

00:20:18.420 --> 00:20:19.690
What's going on?

00:20:20.100 --> 00:20:23.770
Well, my precious memories 
were on the line before,

00:20:23.770 --> 00:20:25.620
so I never tested it.

00:20:26.220 --> 00:20:27.700
But now I know.

00:20:28.490 --> 00:20:31.310
This UNIQUE embedded in my chest

00:20:31.310 --> 00:20:35.130
can activate both Speed Up 
and Slow Down simultaneously,

00:20:35.130 --> 00:20:37.710
just like the latest Oath of Time models.

00:20:37.990 --> 00:20:40.460
I see. So that's it.

00:20:41.010 --> 00:20:42.150
Exactly.

00:20:43.510 --> 00:20:45.640
I made a wall of Slowed Down cards,

00:20:43.550 --> 00:20:45.340
Slow Down x 1000

00:20:46.110 --> 00:20:49.070
and hid some Sped Up cards behind them.

00:20:50.450 --> 00:20:54.600
Your Speed Up tore down my 
Slowed Down wall of cards,

00:20:50.720 --> 00:20:51.980
<b>Speed Up</b>

00:20:56.010 --> 00:21:00.140
but the cards behind them were even 
further Sped Up by your power.

00:20:56.560 --> 00:20:59.070
Speed Up x 500 x 1000

00:20:59.360 --> 00:21:01.320
Speed Up x 500000

00:21:01.400 --> 00:21:01.440
Speed Up x 500000

00:21:01.480 --> 00:21:01.530
Speed Up x 500000

00:21:02.250 --> 00:21:05.160
And the result was the blast you just saw.

00:21:06.630 --> 00:21:11.600
The double Speed Up allowed the cards to gain
a level of speed not ordinarily possible.

00:21:12.470 --> 00:21:15.500
I guess you could call it a 
super-powered card missile.

00:21:17.760 --> 00:21:19.790
And there's one other thing I figured out.

00:21:20.200 --> 00:21:21.920
You may be a god,

00:21:22.500 --> 00:21:26.510
but that doesn't nullify my 
own ability to control time.

00:21:26.950 --> 00:21:31.090
The control of time can only be 
countered by controlling time.

00:21:31.520 --> 00:21:35.520
This is what it means to 
fight under the same rules.

00:21:35.960 --> 00:21:39.040
In other words, even a god is not absolute.

00:21:44.400 --> 00:21:49.070
Well? Is that all there is 
to <i>your</i> "true strength"?

00:21:51.490 --> 00:21:54.750
The Concept of Anxiety

00:23:32.680 --> 00:23:40.180
Beyond Good and Evil
